### Books - Book club endpoints
### Rode cada request clicando no ▶ ao lado de "###" (Android Studio / IntelliJ).
### Crie usuários primeiro (users.http) para usar como admin/membros.

@host = http://localhost:8080

### Listar todos os book clubs
GET {{host}}/api/book-clubs
Accept: application/json

### Buscar book club por id
GET {{host}}/api/book-clubs/1
Accept: application/json

### Criar book club (201) — adminId e visibility são obrigatórios
POST {{host}}/api/book-clubs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Clube da Ficção Científica",
  "adminId": 1,
  "memberIds": [1, 2],
  "image": "https://example.com/sci-fi.png",
  "description": "Discussões mensais sobre clássicos de ficção científica.",
  "visibility": "PUBLIC"
}

### Criar book club privado
POST {{host}}/api/book-clubs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Clube Secreto",
  "adminId": 1,
  "memberIds": [],
  "visibility": "PRIVATE"
}

### Editar book club (200)
PUT {{host}}/api/book-clubs/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Clube da Ficção Científica (atualizado)",
  "adminId": 1,
  "memberIds": [1],
  "description": "Nova descrição.",
  "visibility": "PRIVATE"
}

### Criar com admin inexistente (404)
POST {{host}}/api/book-clubs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Clube Inválido",
  "adminId": 9999,
  "visibility": "PUBLIC"
}

### Criar inválido (400 — name vazio + adminId/visibility ausentes)
POST {{host}}/api/book-clubs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "memberIds": []
}

### Deletar book club (204)
DELETE {{host}}/api/book-clubs/1
